ctive proposal plus host receipts provides append-only scene-scoped provenance.'}\n}\nreasons={\n 'taac2026-academic-1-craft':'No local propagation-instability or reliable-context transport diagnosis. No context transport/gating/distillation adopted.',\n 'taac2026-academic-2-unidac':'Prior context coarsening lost utility. This study keeps every action-age context and has no old/local dual paths or domain exchange; detailed original report unavailable.',\n 'taac2026-academic-3-unitokenformer':'Prior rank8 replacement lost utility; retain width16. No token allocation or decoder change; detailed original report unavailable.',\n 'taac2026-industry-1-queryformer':'No query-construction diagnosis, probes or field-sequence bridge; sparse sharing is not evidence of a source-specific QueryFormer mechanism.',\n 'taac2026-industry-2-unidot':'Inherited direct relevance heads stay fixed. No FM Highway/bus fusion or unavailable conversion supervision. Candidate collision sufficiency is a local hypothesis, not verified transfer.'}\nfor kid,reason in reasons.items():\n p['knowledge_assessments'].append({'knowledge_id':kid,'decision':'considered','rationale':reason+' Current source card and latest declared usage/outcomes reviewed; detailed participant paper not newly inspected, so no detailed reproduction or priority claim.', 'transformed_mechanism':'None adopted from this card; local all-context collision-derived entropy replacement and sparse exact control.', 'variant_names':[], 'nearest_work_difference':'All learned capacities and context resolution remain frozen. Changes are empirical entropy information and its counting execution, not a card architecture.', 'falsifier':'This study cannot falsify the external system; reconsider only after a local diagnosis, primary mechanism verification and matched contrast.'})\nPath('proposal.json').write_text(json.dumps(p,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint('Prospective study recorded in proposal.json before substantive numeric checks.')\nPY\"","aggreg